Repo transfer
-------------
The new pattern mirrors the incoming H=21 window closure: scalar H=21 is decided only after retaining strongness and c3 side conditions.  For pi/e, scalar S or P is also too thin; the retained side conditions are log-commensurability, the discriminant sheet, and transverse symmetric-polynomial fallout.
